      "title": "한국산 참외(멜론)에 대한 호주 측 우려병해충 목록 (제6조 관련)",
      "enforcement_date": "",
      "content": "[별표 1]\n한국산 참외(멜론)에 대한 호주 측 우려병해충 목록 (제6조 관련)\n\n<해충>\n\nAulacophora indica                    오이잎벌레\n\nEpilachna vigintioctomaculata         큰이십팔점박이무당벌레\n\nDrosophila suzukii                    벗초파리\n\nLiriomyza bryoniae                    샐러리잎굴파리\n\nLiriomyza trifolii                    아메리카잎굴파리\n\nPhytomyza horticola                   완두굴파리\n\nZeugodacus depressus*                 호박과실파리*\n\nAphis gossypii                        목화진딧물\n\nBemisia tabaci                        담배가루이\n\nDolycoris baccarum                    알락수염노린재\n\nMegymenum gracilicorne                톱날노린재\n\nTropidothorax cruciger                십자무늬긴노린재\n\nAgrotis segetum                       거세미나방\n\nAnadevidia peponis                    오이금무늬밤나방\n\nCalyptra thalictri                    갈고리큰나방\n\nCtenoplusia agnata                    콩은무늬밤나방\n\nPeridroma saucia                      뒷흰날개밤나방\n\nScopula superior                      줄노랑흰애기자나방\n\nTrichoplusia ni                       양배추은무늬밤나방\n\nAtractomorpha lata                    섬서구메뚜기\n\nGryllotalpa orientalis                땅강아지\n\nFrankliniella intonsa*                대만총채벌레*\n\nFrankliniella occidentalis*           꽃노랑총채벌레*\n\nThrips palmi*                         오이총채벌레*\n\nTarsonemus bilobatus                  갈색먼지응애\n\nTetranychus kanzawai*                 차응애*\n\n<병원균>\n\nErwinia tracheiphila                  세균시들음병\n\nJanibacter melonis                    과일썩음병\n\nMonosporascus cannonballus            검은점뿌리썩음병\n\nFuligo gyrosa                         먼지곰팡이병\n\nPhytophthora melonis                  역병\n\nCucumber fruit mottle mosaic virus    CFMMV\n\nCucumber green mottle mosaic virus    CGMMV\n\nCucurbit aphid-borne yellows virus    CABYV\n\nCucurbit chlorotic yellows virus      CCYV\n\nKyuri green mottle mosaic virus       KGMMV\n\nMelon aphid-borne yellows virus       MABYV\n\nMelon necrotic spot virus             MNSV\n\n* 특별관리병해충",
      "is_file_only": false,
